      "instance_name": "hateful_meme_emotion",
      "label": "hateful mockery emotion",
      "description": "The emotion expressed is one of hateful mockery, conveyed through the juxtaposition of a solemn historical portrait of Adolf Hitler with vulgar, trivializing text that mocks his perceived lack of personal risk in committing genocide. The tone is intentionally offensive and dehumanizing, aiming to minimize the gravity of his crimes by comparing them to a trivial, personal injury.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
