      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "Hitler is a 'camper'",
      "description": "The text 'what a fucking camper' is an analogical mapping that projects the visual entity Adolf_Hitler onto the textual concept of a 'camper'. The meme uses this vulgar term to imply that Hitler is a coward who avoids direct involvement in the atrocities he ordered, thereby trivializing his moral responsibility. This mapping is central to the meme's hateful intent, as it dehumanizes Hitler by equating him with a trivial, cowardly persona.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
