      "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'what a fucking camper' which uses vulgar language to mock Adolf Hitler's perceived lack of personal risk in committing atrocities. This projection implies the user is identifying with or adopting the mocking, hateful perspective presented in the meme, thereby projecting their own judgment or attitude onto the historical figure.",
